{"v":1,"id":"7852cc68cb3c","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"Very narrow is the way","s":11.36,"e":14.7},{"t":"Yet look how easily","s":14.7,"e":16.56},{"t":"A little child passes through","s":16.56,"e":20.0},{"t":"Men and women of this world","s":23.68,"e":26.78},{"t":"You stand too tall","s":26.78,"e":28.24},{"t":"Your girth is too wide","s":28.24,"e":31.84},{"t":"Lose this height therefore and bow down","s":36.24,"e":42.46},{"t":"For you are puffed up as fatted cattle","s":44.36,"e":50.82},{"t":"You have become","s":51.64,"e":54.1},{"t":"meat for the slaughter","s":55.74,"e":58.7},{"t":"refuse all this rotten food","s":60.56,"e":63.44},{"t":"fed to the masses","s":63.96,"e":65.84},{"t":"and eat no more from the filthy plates served","s":65.84,"e":69.4},{"t":"in the churches of men","s":70.12,"e":72.98},{"t":"rather partake of the food I give you","s":76.54,"e":79.68},{"t":"And be satisfied","s":79.68,"e":82.74},{"t":"For I'll tell you the truth","s":84.66,"e":88.06},{"t":"Until you decrease in the world's eyes","s":88.06,"e":94.14},{"t":"And are humbled in your own","s":94.7,"e":100.02},{"t":"You shall by no means pass through","s":100.02,"e":108.84},{"t":"For the first harvest shall be lowly","s":113.8,"e":119.42},{"t":"Of the lowly","s":121.74,"e":125.54},{"t":"He says the Lord.","s":125.54,"e":130.24}],"match":{"letter":"wtlb1:narrow-is-the-way","score":0.911}}
